    <string name="dj_presets">Presets</string>
    <string name="dj_presets_body">A preset is a named set of values for one technique. The selected one is used whenever the planner picks that technique. Save your own from the Transition Lab.</string>
    <string name="dj_preset_defaults">Defaults</string>
    <string name="dj_preset_by_style">Your style chooses the preset for this technique. Choose None as style to pick your own.</string>
    <string name="dj_delete_preset_title">Delete preset?</string>
    <string name="dj_delete_preset_body">\"%1$s\" will be deleted.</string>
    <string name="dj_pins">Pinned pairs</string>
    <string name="dj_pins_body">A pin makes one song always glide into another with the technique you chose, whenever that technique fits the pair. Pins follow the music, not the file, so they survive copies and re-tags.</string>
    <string name="dj_pins_empty">Nothing pinned. Pin a pair from the Transition Lab.</string>
    <string name="dj_unpin">Remove pin</string>
    <string name="dj_unpin_body">Stop pinning %1$s?</string>
    <string name="dj_learned">Learned preferences</string>
    <string name="dj_learned_body">Your ratings raise or lower a technique\'s score in similar situations (tempo matched or not, in key or not, energy rising or falling), between ×0.5 and ×1.5. A few ratings move it a little; many move it more.</string>
    <string name="dj_learned_empty">Nothing learned yet. Rate transitions in the Transition Lab, or run a blind A/B test there.</string>
